Whereas on the 11th day of March 1926 the Council of the League of Nations
                    recorded a decision in the terms set forth in the fourth schedule hereto;
                    and

Cmd. 2370. Anglo-Iraq Treaty of Alliance of October 10, 1922;
                    Protocol of April 30, 1923; and subsidiary Agreements (British Officials,
                    Military, Judicial, and Financial) of March 25, 1924.
